  "translation": "Ashur (Asiri) masakɛ ye ⟨את⟩ Tartan ni ⟨את⟩ Rav-Saris ni ⟨את⟩ Rav-Shake ci Lakish (Lakisi) bɔ ka taa Hizikiyahu masakɛ fɛ, ni jɛ giriman ye, Yerushalayim (Jerusalɛmu) ma. U ye taa ka na Yerushalayim; u ye taa ka na, ka jɔ ji-datugubolo la, ji-lajɛyɔrɔ sanfɛlen la, min bɛ lafasirala foro sira la.",
